+---
+id: task-001-add-stable-identifiers-to-tasks
+type: task
+title: "Add stable identifiers to tasks"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add stable, deterministic IDs to tasks and expose ID lookup through the public task-list API.
+
+Implemented the approved decision in `dl-001-use-sequential-task-identifiers`: each list assigns
+sequential IDs, maintains lookup by ID as well as title, preserves IDs through updates, and does not
+reuse removed IDs. All title-taking operations now accept IDs, and `get(id)` returns the current task
+as a Result. Updated public API comments and README documentation.
+
+Validation: wrote and ran failing tests before implementation, then ran `npm test` successfully
+(12 tests). Coverage includes rename stability, ID-based operations, missing IDs, duplicate titles,
+ID/title collisions and removal without ID reuse. `git diff --check` passes. No runtime dependencies
+were added. A TypeScript compiler is not installed in this repository or available on PATH.
